{"ref":"BDB, עָמֹק²","hw":"עָמֹק²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָמֹק</span></big><sub>17</sub>  <strong>adj. deep (</strong>cf. Ba<sup>NB § 23b</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> lit. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.3\">Lv 13:3</a> + 6 times <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13\" href=\"/Leviticus.13\">Lv 13</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמֻקָּה</span> of cup <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:32\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.32\">Ez 23:32</a>, trench <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 22:14\" href=\"/Proverbs.22.14\">Pr 22:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 23:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.23.27\">23:27</a> (all 3 in sim.); <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ מִשְּׁאוֹל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:8\" href=\"/Job.11.8\">Jb 11:8</a> (fig.); pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַיִם עֲמֻקִּים</span> (sim.) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 18:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.18.4\">Pr 18:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:5\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.5\">20:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> =</strong> <em>unsearchable</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עָמֹק</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 64:7\" href=\"/Psalms.64.7\">ψ 64:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:24\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.24\">Ec 7:24</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמֻקוֹת</span> (Baer <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמוּקוֹת</span>, van d. H. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמֻקּוֹת</span>) <a data-ref=\"Job 12:22\" href=\"/Job.12.22\">Jb 12:22</a>.","next":"BDB, עָמוֹק","prev":"BDB, עָמֵק"}